{"kind": "mod", "id": 2762, "name": "Ghost Voice", "slug": "ghost-voice", "teaser": "Adds Ghost from MW2 2009", "owner_name": "redlaser42", "downloads": 2584, "favourites": 8, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.redlaser42.ghostvoice", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Audio", "category_id": 12, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T09:37:51.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-06-22T05:20:29.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-06-22T05:26:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.3.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>Work in progress voice mod.</p>\n<p>This mod adds a new voice, Ghost, voiced by Craig Fairbrass. Lines were taken from Modern Warfare 2 (2009) and Call of Duty 4 (Gaz). All lines are clean, genuine recordings. No AI.</p>\n<p>Currently up to 151 voice lines including line variations.\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://youtu.be/f7bCuRnfccQ\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://youtu.be/f7bCuRnfccQ</a></p>\n<p>I recommend Smooth Talker, as one of my goals will be to give those voice lines as much variety as possible.\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2635/smooth-talker\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2635/smooth-talker</a></p>\n<p>You can edit the bot types this voice may be chosen for by editing the config in \\SPT\\user\\mods\\Ghost Voice\\db\\CustomVoices\\GhostVoice.json</p>\n<p>Here is a list of all the bots: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://wiki.sp-tarkov.com/en/modding/references/bot-types\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://wiki.sp-tarkov.com/en/modding/references/bot-types</a></p>\n<p>Check against voice weights for each bot type in \\SPT\\SPT_Data\\database\\bots\\types\\</p>\n<p>Appreciation and Acknowledgement:</p>\n<p>Please thank ConcreteMeshTank957 (Topham) for supplying the voice lines on YouTube.\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@american_renaissance\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.youtube.com/@american_renaissance</a></p>\n<p>Please thank the WTT developers for the custom Unity tools, and thank AvienReactor for their voice mod creation guide and template: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/AvienReactor/JellyVoices/wiki/How-to-make-a-SPT-voice-mod\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/AvienReactor/JellyVoices/wiki/How-to-make-a-SPT-voice-mod</a>.</p>\n<p>Thank you to the author of the SPT modding resource.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 2414102, "downloads": 209, "published_at": "2026-06-22T05:25:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2762/ghost-voice/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}]}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 3129404, "downloads": 228, "published_at": "2026-06-22T20:05:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2762/ghost-voice/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}]}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 4498764, "downloads": 414, "published_at": "2026-06-24T02:02:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2762/ghost-voice/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}]}, {"version": "1.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.